    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Articulated task lamp with a clamp base, two spring-balanced arm segments, tension springs, pivot bosses, a conical shade with a rolled rim, an internal reflector and a bulb socket. The clamp screw and jaw are modelled underneath and the shade interior is finished. Uniform orange enamel with clean edges and no branding.",
    "limitations": [
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF; the arm cannot be reposed without adding constraints.",
      "No cable or plug is modelled.",
      "The shade emits no light by default; add an emitter in your scene."
    ],
